399
00:26:31,480 --> 00:26:33,100
你并不直接在Codex上工作
You don't work directly on codex,

400
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:36,540
但如果有一些关于Codex驾驭式工程框架你可以谈的内容
but if there's stuff you can speak about about the codex harness,

401
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:39,600
你们在设计它时都看到了些什么
what you guys see as you architect it out?

402
00:26:40,300 --> 00:26:48,020
嗯 我认为一个非常强大的点是 这些实验室不仅仅是在对模型做后训练
Yeah. So one thing that I think is super powerful is this notion that the labs are not just post-training the models,

403
